+10. 0x08F CounterHi during the crank marker (we do not change it).
+11. Does the car need the 15/s 0xE8 L9 rate at all?
+12. 0x5C0 / 0x1B3 KL50 flags: not sent (0x5C0 is forbidden); PT-CAN2: nothing sent.
